# next two exceptions in advance rather than waiting to repeat that mistake a
# third time when results_banking_legit.csv (B4) and the fixtures/ dry-run
# files are committed.
!harness/results_banking_legit.csv
!harness/fixtures/*.csv
*.xlsx
!data/Description.xlsx
*.crdownload
baseline_predictions.csv
